Hi DM/RM,

The resignation notice provided to HR has been approved. Please process First and Last Name of Rep ID#: 000000 and place in “Pending Termination” in V3 at the end of business MM/DD/YYYY. The employee status in V3 should reflect the employee as “rehireable.”  Please ensure that you are NOT processing the resignation prior to the last day the employee worked. After the employee has moved into inactive status in V3, please remove the employees contact information from your email distribution list and mobile devices.
 
It is especially important to ensure that all work for the employee is completed and reported prior to processing the resignation. If you are experiencing difficulty with the employees’ work being reported, communicate with your RM and HR as soon as possible for assistance.
 
***Please note in V3 that rep is not rehireable for 91 days ACA***
 
Thanks,
 
